  "prefLabel": "Env-A 2902.12 ATS administrator",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 2902.12 “ATS administrator” means:\n\n(a) For an ATS operated and maintained by EPA, the administrator of EPA or the administrator’s designee; or\n\n(b) For an ATS operated and maintained by the department, the commissioner of the department or the commissioner’s designee.\n\nSource. #10002, eff 10-1-11 (from Env-A 2903.12); ss by #12995, eff 2-25-20",
